1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,900
He escaped a Roman trap with two

2
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:03,720
thousand cows and a pile of firewood.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,540
You see, his army is boxed into

4
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:05,900
a valley.

5
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:06,960
Mountains on every side,

6
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,180
and the only road out is a

7
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:10,720
narrow pass, guarded by four thousand Romans.

8
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:12,340
The Roman general just smiles:

9
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,140
"The fox is in the trap."

10
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:15,780
Every day, the food runs lower.

11
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:17,300
Climb the mountains, and his men get

12
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,180
picked off in the dark.

13
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,200
Charge the pass, and they die in

14
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:20,600
the bottleneck.

15
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,400
So he orders his men to collect

16
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,320
dry branches, and every cow they can

17
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:24,520
find.

18
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,420
His officers ask, "Are we fighting Romans,

19
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:27,440
or having a barbecue?"

20
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:29,400
At midnight, they tie the branches to

21
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,840
the horns of two thousand cows,

22
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:31,960
set them on fire,

23
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,220
and drive them up the mountain.

24
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:34,720
The guards at the pass see thousands

25
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:35,900
of torches climbing the ridge.

26
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:37,240
"They're escaping over the mountain!

27
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:37,980
After them!"

28
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:39,140
And they abandon the pass.

29
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:40,220
You see, at night,

30
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:41,520
nobody sees an army.

31
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:42,760
They only see torches.

32
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:44,540
And a torch on a cow looks

33
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:46,320
exactly like a torch in a soldier's

34
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:46,480
hand.

35
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:47,840
So while the Romans chase the lights,

36
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:50,360
his entire army walks quietly through the

37
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:50,800
empty pass.

38
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:52,940
At dawn, the guards finally catch the

39
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:54,120
army they chased all night:

40
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:56,100
two thousand very confused cows.

